Hi there, everyone!

We're very happy to announce that new transations just joined the Beat Cop party! Both Italian and Turkish are now officially availble in our game! We have also fixed some major and minor fixes that you've reported - and still plan to track down more of them and fix as many as possible! Thanks for being awesome and for providing us with a ton of useful feedback, we really appreciate it!

Fixed in version 1.0.694:
Note regarding Terrance mission could not be marked as complete in notebook;
Misleading information about one of the endings (day 21);
Minor visual tweaks in the notebook;
Additional minor tweaks;
We hope you'll enjoy our little update! 

Cheers!

